sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Payment Engine
    participant L as Ledger
    participant B as Banking Provider
    participant R as Reconciliation

    P->>L: Record approved internal accounting event
    P->>B: Submit authorized instruction
    B-->>P: Submission acknowledgement
    P->>R: Send internal reference
    B-->>R: Provider status or statement
    R->>R: Match reference, amount and currency
    alt Matched and settled
        R->>L: Confirm settlement accounting
    else Mismatch or missing evidence
        R->>R: Create reconciliation exception
    end
